% What lesson 9's flaky network should say, probabilities aside.
% A fact must be derived; `:- fact.` must never be, and may use variables.
%
%   python3 diagnose.py programs/prob-reach.dl --expect programs/prob-reach.expect
%   python3 mutation.py programs/prob-reach.dl --expect programs/prob-reach.expect

reach(s, t).
reach(a, b).
:- reach(t, s).                  % links have a direction
:- reach(b, a).
